1. Analytics Pack Story & Design Principles
Momentra should not be judged only by downloads, app opens, or time spent. Its product thesis is that a Moment is a persistent entity that is created, configured, participated in, executed, completed, remembered, and repeated. The analytics system therefore measures both the user and the Moment lifecycle.
The measurement question
Are users adopting Moments as a recurring way to coordinate life and money — and does participation in one Moment create the next creator?

