5.3 Privacy boundary
Do not write user name, phone, email or address to standard analytics events.
Do not write Moment title, free-text description, notes, messages, captions, image URLs or document contents.
Do not write payment credentials, bank credentials, auth tokens or raw exception stacks.
Structured amount + currency may be used where required for product analytics; operational finance remains the system of record.
